format-version: 1.2
data-version: hp/releases/2026-01-01
remark: Synthetic fixture. Not an HPO release. Twenty terms with hand-computable
remark: information content, so every assertion in the tests is arithmetic a reader
remark: can redo on paper. Real HPO ids are reused so the shape is recognisable.

